# Repository Labels

Use these to route issues through the Flywheel:

| Label | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `observation` | Raw friction from reality |
| `field-note` | Observation + initial research |
| `research` | Deep investigation in progress |
| `pattern` | 3+ observations pointing to same mechanism |
| `gate-candidate` | Ready to become Handbook principle |
| `documentation` | Docs, templates, repo maintenance |
| `question` | Something to investigate |
| `dispatch` | HakunaShortcut public test |

*Every issue should have 1 primary label.*
